{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And He said: I will hide My face from them.</b> As the Targum [renders]: 'I will remove My Shekhinah from them.' And since I am removing [it], I will see what their end will be — what will those deities they chose avail them?" "<b>For they are a generation of perversities.</b> That they reckon the good I did for them as evil; thus they deny Me and despise My commandments."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:47.197913261Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}